            <ArticleTitle>Directed nucleophilic addition of phenoxides to cyclopropenes.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>8153-8165</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7ob01785e</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The alkali metal-templated addition of aryloxides across the double bond of non-conjugated cyclopropenes is described. High cis-selectivity is achieved through a directing effect of a strategically positioned carboxamide functionality.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
